WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.867
Every trend cycle,

2
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:07.419
the senior team spent two to three weeks on research.

3
00:00:07.419 --> 00:00:09.210
Twenty sources, checked by hand.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.290
So we built the Trend Intelligence Platform.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.804
It monitors over a thousand sources,

6
00:00:14.804 --> 00:00:17.610
and drafts the trend report for the team to refine.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:27.722
Open any trend,

8
00:00:27.722 --> 00:00:29.262
and the evidence is right there,

9
00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:30.754
with what it doesn't prove yet.

10
00:00:30.754 --> 00:00:32.400
Pick the ones worth pursuing.

11
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.138
And it turns them into an opportunity brief.

12
00:00:42.138 --> 00:00:45.110
Product concepts, and the questions to test with buyers.

13
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.315
Weeks of research, now under four hours.

14
00:00:57.315 --> 00:01:00.400
So senior time goes back on strategy and clients.

15
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.340
Every trend. Backed by evidence.
